{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Hey Evan! Long time no see, how's it going?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-958c2727504727cb3768121b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:56.879208+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "958c2727504727cb3768121b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "958c2727504727cb3768121b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Hey Sam! Long time no see! Been up and down lately, got married last week - how about you?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-459e20d1acee9b4b7305b283", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:56.898517+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "459e20d1acee9b4b7305b283", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "459e20d1acee9b4b7305b283", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Congratulations, Evan! Is that the woman from Canada?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-f565b922441ee934d585169c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:56.911517+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f565b922441ee934d585169c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f565b922441ee934d585169c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Yes, that's her, I don't know why we didn't get married before, because I was in love with her at first sight!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-c0534f235d3dd084e651a6b2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:56.926523+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c0534f235d3dd084e651a6b2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c0534f235d3dd084e651a6b2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Wow, Evan! Love at first sight? That sounds like something straight out of a fairy tale. What are your thoughts on it? Do you believe in love at first sight?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-b70df64e55ccf70ae197552b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:56.940522+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b70df64e55ccf70ae197552b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b70df64e55ccf70ae197552b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: I totally believe in it. It was like time stopped and I felt like a spark lit inside me - it was so right."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-cc3e90ba78bdaee72561cc8c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:56.953524+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cc3e90ba78bdaee72561cc8c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cc3e90ba78bdaee72561cc8c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: That's awesome, Evan! Finding that kind of connection must feel really liberating. Love can be so powerful, huh?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-b8a1850b8c66947574658a7d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:56.969915+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b8a1850b8c66947574658a7d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b8a1850b8c66947574658a7d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Yeah, Sam, love is truly amazing. It brings so much happiness and fulfillment, like a beautiful sunset that lights up our lives and brings peace. Incredible!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-41c580be961f00476ac86730", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:56.983545+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "41c580be961f00476ac86730", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "41c580be961f00476ac86730", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Wish I could feel the same about love, but I've started to enjoy running in the mornings, and it's been a great way to clear my head. What can you do, right?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-233d0f6ffa29fcb8d233b650", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:56.995619+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "233d0f6ffa29fcb8d233b650", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "233d0f6ffa29fcb8d233b650", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Yeah, I get it. Life's all about finding what works for you. Like your morning runs, they're a step towards something good, right? Keep trying new things, Sam, and you might find your own version of love in the most unexpected places. Embrace the journey \u2014 it\u2019s full of surprises!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-c9ec55b2e5bd5d13a78b747b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:57.011304+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c9ec55b2e5bd5d13a78b747b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c9ec55b2e5bd5d13a78b747b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Such a minimalistic and stunning piece of work, I wonder what inspired the artist to create it."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-67d804742120265bcd7b9209", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:57.028969+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "67d804742120265bcd7b9209", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "67d804742120265bcd7b9209", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: The painting is mine, I made it when I was a mix of emotions - sad, mad, and hopeful. Art is amazing how it can portray feelings without words."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-0984194b9a56cb5ea0dcefca", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:57.042638+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0984194b9a56cb5ea0dcefca", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0984194b9a56cb5ea0dcefca", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Wow, Evan! Art is really amazing at expressing emotions - it's truly fascinating."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-90577caebcfd4faff201a215", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:57.059510+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "90577caebcfd4faff201a215", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "90577caebcfd4faff201a215", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: It's amazing how art can express emotions so well. It really helps me recognize and handle my own feelings. This painting is giving me a massive rush of joy!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-aad50ddedae13474d00ab8ab", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:57.073397+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "aad50ddedae13474d00ab8ab", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "aad50ddedae13474d00ab8ab", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: That's stunning! What emotions did you create this painting with?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-dbd9610f9134f184b4c77701", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:57.089414+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dbd9610f9134f184b4c77701", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dbd9610f9134f184b4c77701", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: I painted this with a sense of joy and freedom. The spontaneous strokes and bold colors reflect a playful and liberated mood, embracing the creative process without restraint."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-2c51380519dd3beed0b6e63d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:57.103176+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2c51380519dd3beed0b6e63d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2c51380519dd3beed0b6e63d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Wow, Evan, this is amazing! You've got serious talent and creativity. Making this must have been so satisfying! Here's a painting that inspired me when I went to an exhibit few days ago."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-ddd86e11810a8cc361e3e16b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:57.118957+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ddd86e11810a8cc361e3e16b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ddd86e11810a8cc361e3e16b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Thanks, Sam! I appreciate the compliment. This painting has such an inspiring vibe; you really have a knack for understanding art! How about you? How long have you been painting?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-6e3f0b89bc2a3e994aeebf18", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:57.136722+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6e3f0b89bc2a3e994aeebf18", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6e3f0b89bc2a3e994aeebf18", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: I do sketch occasionally, but I haven't created anything remarkable yet. I have a feeling I'll have something to show off before long! Seeing your passion for it is inspiring."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-dee213aa63f01275a6c760f1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:57.151882+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dee213aa63f01275a6c760f1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dee213aa63f01275a6c760f1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Thanks, Sam! Glad I could motivate you. If you ever want to give it a go, I'm happy to help get you started. Speaking of which, you know what? I lost my keys again, it's become a weekly ritual for me!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-f21d870b3d735b11341fa809", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:57.168900+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f21d870b3d735b11341fa809", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f21d870b3d735b11341fa809", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Ooh, Evan, I'd put a GPS sensor on your keys!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-7a18a06d0828826472a128ef", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:57.182077+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7a18a06d0828826472a128ef", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7a18a06d0828826472a128ef", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Great idea, I think I'll do that as soon as I find it!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-49/session_21-089caa05869be09ddaa39b16", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:02:57.202441+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "089caa05869be09ddaa39b16", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "089caa05869be09ddaa39b16", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
